  boothLines:
  - Mangos. It's mangos. Ataulfo. The good ones. Very... mango.
  - Sorry, it's hot. Is it hot in here? It's hot. You should get a fan. I could get
    you a fan.
  - No, I didn't load it. A guy loaded it. A different guy. A guy I don't know. Normal
    stuff.
  lineIfApproved: Thank you. Thank you. Don't... don't think about it, okay? I'm
    trying not to.
  lineIfRejected: Back? I can't go back with them. You don't understand what they'll...
    okay. Okay.
  lineIfImprisoned: ...Are they gonna be okay? The ones in the back. Somebody should
    give them water. Please.
  bribeAmount: 40
  bribeLine: Look... jefe. Those are... very heavy mangos. Forty dollars says they're
    mangos. It's all I have. I don't want trouble. I just want to drive.
  newsIfApproved:
  - headline: Abandoned Produce Van Found Outside Odessa
    body: The engine was off. The back doors were locked from the outside. Between
      the crates of mangos, two people were still breathing. The driver has not been
      found.
    daysLater: 0
    frontPage: 1
  newsIfRejected:
  - headline: "Burned Van Found Near Ciudad Ju\xE1rez"
    body: '"It smelled like fruit," said a firefighter. No one was inside. No one
      has reported it missing.'
    daysLater: 1
    frontPage: 1
  newsIfImprisoned:
  - headline: Two Taken Into Federal Custody
    body: Officials did not release their names. A crate of mangos was entered as
      evidence.
    daysLater: 0
    frontPage: 0
  - headline: Deportation Hearings Scheduled for Thursday
    body: Two of the cases have no attorney assigned. The court calendar lists them
      only by number.
    daysLater: 2
    frontPage: 0
